    <p><strong>ProBrothers is a full-service home remodeling contractor in Media, PA, covering kitchen remodeling, bathroom renovations, basement finishing, and whole-home redesigns across Delaware County and the Main Line.</strong> Every remodel is managed in-house — the same team handles demo, framing, electrical coordination, finish carpentry, and trim work. We provide written weekly progress updates throughout the project. Kitchen remodels typically $20,000–$80,000; bathroom remodels $8,000–$35,000. Free quote within one business day. 15+ years &middot; 5.0 rating.</p>
  </aside>

